// "double <subject>'s power [<duration>]": To double a creature's power, it gets +X/+0, where X is its power as the doubling resolves [CR#701.10b]. Adding a negative power doubles it as [CR#701.10c] says. One expansion of the
// "double" keyword action, which has several, chosen by what is doubled
// [CR#701.10a,701.11a].
(
    name: "doublePower",
    kinds: [Instruction],
    params: {"subject": Subject, "duration": Default(Any, None)},
    body: Establish(PtModification(Param(subject), up(powerOf(Param(subject))), up(0)), Param(duration)),
)
